# Base: exists from game start (never placeable). Respawn anchor + passive mineral income; conducts
# grid links like any structure. Its shield runs on EMITTER RULES (tickPower's hasShieldEmitter
# path): it drains the Base's own energy store (feed it power cables) and goes dark when starved;
# output/reach come from the "Base shield" tweaks, not this file. DAMAGEABLE - health drops to
# enemy territory/melee/projectiles - but the death sweep never destroys it (no lose condition yet).
Prefab gameBase
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.95 0.95 1
		Scale 3
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 3 3 3
	Component Force
		Team 0
		Output 2.4
		Reach 24
		Centered true
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 3
